742f8865 (626 1792286166610 "guenchi" (("w5vbequy" . 14982)) (put ((kind . section) (title . "landing f306") (src . "one comparison-domain judgement for publication and import\n\nlanding-files exports base-entry-judgement, the one reading of a git entry both tools\nshare: dot-named, a link, a submodule, an unsupported mode, not text, or in the domain.\nimport-git's precondition asks it and behaves as before; publish-landing asks it too, and\na file that is not text, which the store never holds, is now neither compared nor exempt\nand is listed as skipped, where before it refused the base as mismatched. The README\nsays what each tool skips and the answer's shape for it.\n") (parent . root) (ord . 414))))
